{"id":4114,"date":"2017-06-20T12:23:10","date_gmt":"2017-06-20T12:23:10","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/?page_id=4114"},"modified":"2017-06-20T12:23:10","modified_gmt":"2017-06-20T12:23:10","slug":"privacy-policy","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/privacy-policy\/","title":{"rendered":"Privacy Policy"},"content":{"rendered":"<!-- ATOSPP version: 3.0.3, my_privacy_policy -->    <h2 id='atospp-privacy' class='auto-tos-pp ppheading'>Privacy Policy:<\/h2>\n    <p>Daily News (&quot;<strong>Daily News<\/strong>&quot;)\n        operates news.loudsites.com and may operate other websites. It\n        is Daily News policy to respect your privacy regarding any information we may collect\n        while operating our websites.<\/p>\n    <h3>Website Visitors<\/h3>\n    <p>Like most website operators, Daily News collects non-personally-identifying information of the\n        sort that web browsers and servers typically make available, such as the browser type, language preference,\n        referring site, and the date and time of each visitor request. Daily News purpose in\n        collecting non-personally identifying information is to better understand\n        how Daily News visitors use its website. From time to\n        time, Daily News may release non-personally-identifying information in the aggregate, e.g., by\n        publishing a report on trends in the usage of its website.<\/p>\n    <p>Daily News also collects potentially personally-identifying information like Internet Protocol\n        (IP) addresses for logged in users and for users leaving comments on news.loudsites.com        blogs\/sites. Daily News only discloses logged in user and commenter IP addresses under the same\n        circumstances that it uses and discloses personally-identifying information as described below, except that\n        commenter IP addresses and email addresses are visible and disclosed to the administrators of the blog\/site\n        where the comment was left.<\/p>\n    <h3>Gathering of Personally-Identifying Information<\/h3>\n    <p>Certain visitors to Daily News websites choose to interact\n        with Daily News in ways that require Daily News to gather\n        personally-identifying information. The amount and type of information that Daily News gathers\n        depends on the nature of the interaction. For example, we ask visitors who sign up at <a\n                href=\"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\">news.loudsites.com<\/a> to provide a\n        username and email address. Those who engage in transactions with Daily News are asked to\n        provide additional information, including as necessary the personal and financial information required to\n        process those transactions. In each case, Daily News collects such information only insofar as\n        is necessary or appropriate to fulfill the purpose of the visitor's interaction with\n\t\tDaily News. Daily News does not disclose personally-identifying information\n        other than as described below. And visitors can always refuse to supply personally-identifying information, with\n        the caveat that it may prevent them from engaging in certain website-related activities.<\/p>\n    <h3>Aggregated Statistics<\/h3>\n    <p>Daily News may collect statistics about the behavior of visitors to its\n        websites. Daily News may display this information publicly or provide it to others.\n        However, Daily News does not disclose personally-identifying information other than as\n        described below.<\/p>\n    <h3>Protection of Certain Personally-Identifying Information<\/h3>\n    <p>Daily News discloses potentially personally-identifying and personally-identifying information\n        only to those of its employees, contractors and affiliated organizations that (i) need to know that information\n        in order to process it on Daily News behalf or to provide services available\n        at Daily News websites, and (ii) that have agreed not to disclose it to others. Some\n        of those employees, contractors and affiliated organizations may be located outside of your home country; by\n        using Daily News websites, you consent to the transfer of such information to\n        them. Daily News will not rent or sell potentially personally-identifying and\n        personally-identifying information to anyone. Other than to its employees, contractors and affiliated\n        organizations, as described above, Daily News discloses potentially personally-identifying and\n        personally-identifying information only in response to a subpoena, court order or other governmental request, or\n        when Daily News believes in good faith that disclosure is reasonably necessary to protect the\n        property or rights of Daily News, third parties or the public at large. If you are a registered\n        user of an Daily News website and have supplied your email address, Daily News        may occasionally send you an email to tell you about new features, solicit your feedback, or just keep you up to\n        date with what's going on with Daily News and our products. If you send us a request (for\n        example via email or via one of our feedback mechanisms), we reserve the right to publish it in order to help us\n        clarify or respond to your request or to help us support other users. Daily News takes all\n        measures reasonably necessary to protect against the unauthorized access, use, alteration or destruction of\n        potentially personally-identifying and personally-identifying information.<\/p>\n    <h3>Cookies<\/h3>\n    <p>A cookie is a string of information that a website stores on a visitor's computer, and that the visitor's browser\n        provides to the website each time the visitor returns. Daily News uses cookies to\n        help Daily News identify and track visitors, their usage of Daily News        website, and their website access preferences. Daily News visitors who do not wish to have\n        cookies placed on their computers should set their browsers to refuse cookies before\n        using Daily News websites, with the drawback that certain features\n        of Daily News websites may not function properly without the aid of cookies.<\/p>\n    <h3>Business Transfers<\/h3>\n    <p>If Daily News, or substantially all of its assets, were acquired, or in the unlikely event\n        that Daily News goes out of business or enters bankruptcy, user information would be one of the\n        assets that is transferred or acquired by a third party. You acknowledge that such transfers may occur, and that\n        any acquirer of Daily News may continue to use your personal information as set forth in this\n        policy.<\/p>\n    <h3>Ads<\/h3>\n    <p>Ads appearing on any of our websites may be delivered to users by advertising partners, who may set cookies.\n        These cookies allow the ad server to recognize your computer each time they send you an online advertisement to\n        compile information about you or others who use your computer. This information allows ad networks to, among\n        other things, deliver targeted advertisements that they believe will be of most interest to you. This Privacy\n        Policy covers the use of cookies by Daily News and does not cover the use of cookies by any\n        advertisers.<\/p>\n    <h3>Privacy Policy Changes<\/h3>\n    <p>Although most changes are likely to be minor, Daily News may change\n        its Privacy Policy from time to time, and in Daily News sole\n        discretion. Daily News encourages visitors to frequently check this page for any changes to\n        its Privacy Policy. If you have a news.loudsites.com account, you might also\n        receive an alert informing you of these changes. Your continued use of this site after any change in\n        this Privacy Policy will constitute your acceptance of such change.<\/p>\n\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":0,"parent":0,"menu_order":3,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_exactmetrics_skip_tracking":false,"_exactmetrics_sitenote_active":false,"_exactmetrics_sitenote_note":"","_exactmetrics_sitenote_category":0,"footnotes":""},"class_list":["post-4114","page","type-page","status-publish","hentry"],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4114","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/page"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=4114"}],"version-history":[{"count":0,"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/pages\/4114\/revisions"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/dailyglobal.info\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=4114"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}